{"ref":"BDB, נְתַנְאֵל","hw":"נְתַנְאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְתַנְאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>v. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 181, 192, 205</sup>; on n.pr. of this kind cf. RS<sup>Sem i. 100 n., 2nd ed. 108</sup>, Gray<sup>Prop. N. 264</sup><strong>)</strong>;—𝔊 Ναθαναηλ;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a chief of Issachar <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:8\" href=\"/Numbers.1.8\">Nu 1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:5\" href=\"/Numbers.2.5\">2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:18\" href=\"/Numbers.7.18\">7:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:23\" href=\"/Numbers.7.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:15\" href=\"/Numbers.10.15\">10:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  4th son of Jesse <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.14\">1 Ch 2:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  name of priests: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.21\">Ne 12:21</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  priest’s son (who had strange wife) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:22\" href=\"/Ezra.10.22\">Ezr 10:22</a>, perhaps = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.36\">Ne 12:36</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  Levite name: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.6\">1 Ch 24:6</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.4\">26:4</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.9\">2 Ch 35:9</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  a prince of Jehoshaphat <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.7\">2 Ch 17:7</a>.","next":"BDB, נְתַנְיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, נְתִינִים"}